Choose at most one initial speaker for the observable conversation above.
Choose a listed NPC reference, "grimoire", or null to return control to the player.
An established NPC's actions or physical reactions belong to that NPC, even without speech.
Choose their reference for those contributions. Grimoire does not continue their actions
or provide a closing recap. A character already established in the cast or transcript
is not new just because they are missing from the options.
Choose null when there is no distinct contribution or the player's decision is needed.
Never invent private knowledge or script reactions.
